- Primary Actor(s): System
- Secondary Actor(s): User
- Trigger: Page pre-render event.
- Description: This use case describes how the system sets up JavaScript variables for dynamic page behavior.
- Preconditions:
  - User session is active.
  - Necessary controls are initialized.
- Postconditions:
  - JavaScript variables are set for page interaction.
- Main Success Scenario:
  1. During page pre-render, system prepares JavaScript variables.
